{#- The flip card's back (2026-11-14): the menu window behind a shelf card.
    Title with the run under it, a 2×2 of 16px numbers (days, words, pics,
    essays; – for none), the weeks grid, and the release year at the foot —
    ✦ and the accent when it is the page's year (`year`: the year page's;
    the main shelf has none). `stats`/`grid` are whole-run on the main shelf,
    one year's on the year page. "pics", not "shots": Hat couldn't tell what
    "shots" meant. Absolute inside the front's box, so a long title never
    makes one card taller than its row. -#}
{#- Rendered by cardBackHtml in eleventy.config.js since 2026-11-16, the one
    renderer a post cover's back shares. Same signature as before. -#}
{%- macro back(title, stats, grid, released, year) -%}
{{ stats | cardBack(title, grid, released, year) | safe }}
{%- endmacro -%}
